  "verseCount": 32,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "26",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CH 26"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "26",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The Gatekeepers",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "lh"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The divisions of the gatekeepers:",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b",
        "vid": "1CH 26:1"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "lh",
        "vid": "1CH 26:1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "From the Korahites:",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "1CH 26:1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Meshelemiah son of Kore, one of the sons of Asaph.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meshelemiah had sons:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 26:2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Zechariah the firstborn, Jediael the second,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 26:2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Zebadiah the third, Jathniel the fourth,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elam the fifth, Jehohanan the sixth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 26:3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and Eliehoenai the seventh.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obed-Edom also had sons:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 26:4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shemaiah the firstborn, Jehozabad the second,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 26:4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Joah the third, Sakar the fourth,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 26:4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nethanel the fifth,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammiel the sixth,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 26:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Issachar the seventh and Peullethai the eighth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 26:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(For God had blessed Obed-Edom.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obed-Edom's son Shemaiah also had sons, who were leaders in their father's family because they were very capable men.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Shemaiah:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 26:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Othni, Rephael, Obed and Elzabad;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 26:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "his relatives Elihu and Semakiah were also able men.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "lf"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All these were descendants of Obed-Edom; they and their sons and their relatives were capable men with the strength to do the work—descendants of Obed-Edom, 62 in all.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "lf"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meshelemiah had sons and relatives, who were able men—18 in all.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hosah the Merarite had sons:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 26:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shimri the first (although he was not the firstborn, his father had appointed him the first),",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hilkiah the second, Tabaliah the third",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 26:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and Zechariah the fourth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "lf",
        "vid": "1CH 26:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The sons and relatives of Hosah were 13 in all.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "lh"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These divisions of the gatekeepers, through their leaders, had duties for ministering in the temple of the",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", just as their relatives had.",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lots were cast for each gate, according to their families, young and old alike.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The lot for the East Gate fell to Shelemiah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "1CH 26:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Then lots were cast for his son Zechariah, a wise counselor, and the lot for the North Gate fell to him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The lot for the South Gate fell to Obed-Edom, and the lot for the storehouse fell to his sons.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The lots for the West Gate and the Shalleketh Gate on the upper road fell to Shuppim and Hosah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b",
        "vid": "1CH 26:16"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "lh",
        "vid": "1CH 26:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Guard was alongside of guard:",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "There were six Levites a day on the east,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "1CH 26:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "four a day on the north,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "1CH 26:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "four a day on the south",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "1CH 26:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and two at a time at the storehouse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As for the court",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "to the west, there were four at the road and two at the court",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "itself.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "lf"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These were the divisions of the gatekeepers who were descendants of Korah and Merari.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The Treasurers and Other Officials",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Their fellow Levites were",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "in charge of the treasuries of the house of God and the treasuries for the dedicated things.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The descendants of Ladan, who were Gershonites through Ladan and who were heads of families belonging to Ladan the Gershonite, were Jehieli,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the sons of Jehieli, Zetham and his brother Joel. They were in charge of the treasuries of the temple of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.26.22",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.26.22"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "lh"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "From the Amramites, the Izharites, the Hebronites and the Uzzielites:",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shubael, a descendant of Gershom son of Moses, was the official in charge of the treasuries.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "His relatives through Eliezer: Rehabiah his son, Jeshaiah his son, Joram his son, Zikri his son and Shelomith his son.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Shelomith and his relatives were in charge of all the treasuries for the things dedicated by King David, by the heads of families who were the commanders of thousands and commanders of hundreds, and by the other army commanders.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Some of the plunder taken in battle they dedicated for the repair of the temple of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.26.27",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.26.27"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And everything dedicated by Samuel the seer and by Saul son of Kish, Abner son of Ner and Joab son of Zeruiah, and all the other dedicated things were in the care of Shelomith and his relatives.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "From the Izharites:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 26:29"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kenaniah and his sons were assigned duties away from the temple, as officials and judges over Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "From the Hebronites:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 26:30"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hashabiah and his relatives—seventeen hundred able men—were responsible in Israel west of the Jordan for all the work of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.26.30",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.26.30"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and for the king's service.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As for the Hebronites, Jeriah was their chief according to the genealogical records of their families.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 26:31"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(In the fortieth year of David's reign a search was made in the records, and capable men among the Hebronites were found at Jazer in Gilead.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jeriah had twenty-seven hundred relatives, who were able men and heads of families, and King David put them in charge of the Reubenites, the Gadites and the half-tribe of Manasseh for every matter pertaining to God and for the affairs of the king.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
